      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/me/fields",
      "summary": "Return the profile version and every active field definition with its stored value.",
      "description": "Lists active field definitions ordered by sort_order and field_key. value and field_version are null when the patient has not stored that field. version is the patient profile version used for optimistic concurrency.",
