      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/records/emergency",
      "summary": "Look up a patient emergency projection by 12-digit patient code.",
      "description": "Any authenticated account can attempt an emergency read. A valid 12-digit code returns the ordered emergency projection. Invalid, unknown or unconfigured codes return 200 with available false. Five denied attempts in ten minutes throttle the account and also return available false.",
